cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cello in a project, cite this software release."
title: "Cello: Biochemical Cell Simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bitar
    given-names: Abdsalam
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: LicenseRef-Proprietary
abstract: >-
  Cello is an interactive biochemical cell simulator and research-oriented
  visualization platform for Windows x64. Version 3.0 adds a broad
  cell-aware biochemical pathway atlas, multiple pathway graph modes,
  brighter and more dynamic cell visualization, DNA-replication visualization,
  and a triggerable mitosis/cytokinesis demonstration while preserving the
  v2.1 kinetic core.
keywords:
  - biochemistry
  - cell simulation
  - systems biology
  - scientific visualization
  - biochemical pathways
  - cell cycle
  - mitosis
  - computational biology
